OL,3,GNEWSACall for more treatment options
OL,4,Afor brain tumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrain Tumour Research says south-west
OL,7,FEngland has the second highest rate of
OL,8,Fbrain tumours per 100,000 in England
OL,9,Fbut claims the condition is allocated
OL,10,Fjust 1% of national spending on cancer
OL,11,Fresearch.
OL,13,FThe charity says in the UK the
OL,14,Fcondition kills more children and
OL,15,Fadults under the age of 40 than any
OL,16,Fother cancer.
