OL,3,GNEWSACall for more treatment options
OL,4,Afor brain tumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have joined patients and
OL,7,Fscientists at the University of
OL,8,FPlymouth's Brain Tumour Research Centre
OL,9,Fin calling on the prime minister to
OL,10,Fincrease funding to help find more
OL,11,Ftreatments for brain cancer.
OL,13,FEarlier this year the government passed
OL,14,Fthe Rare Cancers Act - one of its aims
OL,15,Fis to provide earlier detection and
OL,16,Fimproved treatment for brain cancers.
